    "detailed_description": "&quot;Explosive Shooting Star Beetle&quot; is an exhilarating bullet-hell shooter where you aim for explosive cherry chains. Collect as many cherries as you can and create massive combos!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6single Player</h2>  Aim for high scores by chaining explosions and climb the leaderboard! Be cautious, though\u2014the higher your score, the more challenging the explosions become.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6online Multiplayer</h2>  You can also compete online. Create chains of explosions to generate nuisance blocks for your opponent. Push these blocks onto your opponent's screen to gain the upper hand in the game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6visuals</h2>  Enjoy charming and nostalgic 2D pixel art with a ladybug and star theme.",
